<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIVE, France 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the second</p>
<p>semifinal of the European Cup on Sunday:</p>
<p> Brive (France)   26   Cardiff (Wales)  13 (halftime 9-3)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brive - Tries: David Venditti, Francois Duboisset.</p>
<p>Conversions: Christophe Lamaison (2). Penalties: Lamaison (4)</p>
<p>Cardiff - Try: one penalty try. Conversion: Jonathan Davies.</p>
<p>Penalties: Davies (2).</p>
<p>Brive meet Leicester of England in the final on January 25.</p>
<p>European Conference semifinals:</p>
<p> Castres     23     Agen	   6</p>
<p> Bourgoin    29     Narbonne     6</p>
</text>
